{
    "title": "Solitaire - Classic Card Games",
    "description": "<b>Solitaire - Classic Solitaire Card Games by Beetles</b> reveals a captivating world of classic solitaire card games, making it a perfect match for enthusiasts of classic games and solitaire lovers alike! If you're a  real fan of card games, especially Solitaire Classic, then diving into Solitaire - Classic Solitaire Card Games by Beetles is a <b>MUST</b>. It's not merely a game;  it's a journey back to those classic vibes, a real trip down memory lane. You're going to adore it! Don't hesitate! <b>PLAY</b> Solitaire - Classic Solitaire Card Game today on your iPad and Phones for <b>FREE</b> and start your solitaire journey!\r\n\r\n<b>SOLITAIRE</b>, that classic game we all crushed on computers, is now super easy to play on your phone and tablet. It's the ultimate time killer that keeps your brain sharp. Whether you're an Android lover or an iOS fan, downloading our Solitaire Classic card game free for iPad, phone and tablet is a no-brainer, especially for card game lovers looking for that classic card vibe. Enjoy the timeless entertainment of Solitaire and immerse yourself in the world of classic solitaire and classic games with our Solitaire games!\r\n\r\nIn our <b>Classic Solitaire Card Games</b>, there are over 9000+ classic solitaire games waiting for you to explore! Plus, a wide variety of solitaire themes for Classic games and Cards are available for you to choose from, allowing you to make every solitaire game uniquely beautiful with your customized background. With Solitaire Classic, you can truly embrace the essence of classic card playing. Enjoy the timeless joy of Solitaire and dive into endless fun with our carefully crafted Classic Solitaire Card Games!\r\n\r\nSolitaire is hitting that classic card game vibe but with a fresh twist. With its original Solitaire Classic charm and a super slick, easy-to-use interface, it's all about classic fun without the fuss. Dive into Solitaire free anytime, anywhere - no ads, no pop-ups, just pure Classic Solitaire joy. Whether you're a fan of Classic games or just looking for a quick card break, we've got you covered with the perfect mix of nostalgia and modern play. Ready for some timeless Solitaire fun? Let's play Solitaire!\r\n\r\n<b>How to play Classic Solitaire Card Games</b>\r\nJump into Solitaire Classic games, a free and classic card game where you sort a deck into four piles by suit and in sequence. Start with cards spread across seven columns and a stockpile. \r\nYour goal? Move these cards to the foundation piles, stacking them in alternating colors and descending order, like a black spade 8 under a red heart 9.\r\nEmpty space? Only a king or a sequence with a king fits. Think of it as organizing a party where every card finds its spot. \r\nThe key to winning Classic Solitaire? Plan wisely and keep columns tidy. Solitaire Classic isn't just a brain teaser; it's a chill way to enjoy classic games and play with cards. Ready to play? Let's dive into Solitaire!\r\n\r\n<b>SOLITAIRE BY BEETLES FEATURES:</b>\r\n<b>Original Classic Solitaire:</b>\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Play Classic Solitaire draw 1 & draw 3 modes\r\n\u2665\ufe0f Choose scoring mode: Standard or Vegas Solitaire scoring\r\n<b>Daily Challenge:</b>\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Challenge yourself with the hard mode in Solitaire Classic\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Receive a special mark every day for completing Solitaire challenges\r\n\u2660\ufe0f Build your own Trophies Display Rack for Classic games\r\n<b>User Friendly Experience:</b>\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Enjoy clean and comfortable visual design in Classic Solitaire\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Multiple themes to choose from and customize your Solitaire background\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Customize the table and cards style for your Solitaire Classic games\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Play Offline: Play random deals of Classic Solitaire everywhere\r\n\u2666\ufe0f Supports left-handed play for Classic games       \r\n<b>Stats Tracker:</b>\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Record every achievement you made in Solitaire Classic\r\n\u2663\ufe0f Stay Sharp and see every improvement in your Classic Solitaire skills\r\n\r\nIf you have any advice, email us at support@dailyinnovation.biz. We appreciate your advice so that we can make this Solitaire card game better.",
